{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10122030","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10122030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1012203001:0":{"text":"휴윈 양, 거기 있는 거 알아요. 당신의 이슬로 사람들을 구해달라는 부탁을 받고 왔어요.","source_cn":"伊温小姐，我知道你在。我们受人所托，想请你用露珠救助大家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EA0BA253FB8EBAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012203002:0":{"text":"미안해요… 저는… 몸을 뺄 수가 없어요…","source_cn":"对不起……我……无法抽身……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB54F44B0D0BB80CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012203003:0":{"text":"비가 멈추면, 재앙이… 급속도로 퍼질 거예요. 제가… 재앙을 막을 수는 없어도… 늦출 수는 있어요…","source_cn":"如果雨停了，灾难……会迅速蔓延。虽然我……无法阻止，但...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D2AB840EC1C513B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012203004:0":{"text":"휴윈 양, 억지로 버티지 말아요! 벌써 지치신 것 같군요… 당신의 힘으론 부패를 막을 수 없을지도 몰라요.","source_cn":"伊温小姐，别硬撑啊！你听上去已经精疲力尽了……以你的力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x566861D42B82100A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012203005:0":{"text":"비가… 멈춘다면 제 친구는… 안 돼요! 반드시 친구를 지켜야 해요…","source_cn":"如果……雨停下来，我的朋友将会……不行！<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB953D12A6990F183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012203006:0":{"text":"제 친구가 곧 이성을 잃어버릴 거예요… 영원히 날 잊어버리고… 심지어 내 적이 될 거예요.","source_cn":"我的朋友快要失去理智了……他会永远忘记我，甚至……变成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CBCCB5C8381CCA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1012203007:0":{"text":"여러분… <style=\"highlight\">제 친구를 구해 주세요</style>. 그는 꽃말 협곡에 있어요. 성격이 온순한 털북숭이지만, 지금… 고통스러워해요. ","source_cn":"各位……<style=highlight>请救救我的朋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x184395BFEBAEDCBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012203008:0":{"text":"꼭 보답할게요. 제가 할 수 있는 건 뭐든 다 할게요.","source_cn":"我会报答大家，只要我能做到……让我做什么都可以。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B8C29AE0A887DE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊温":{"text":"휴윈","source":"伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}